<properties>
{"title":"Close CRM SOPs (Closers)"}
</properties>
<content>
<callout icon="⚠️" color="yellow_bg">
	CRM is your accountability tool. Bad notes = bad handoffs = lost deals. Every interaction gets logged. No exceptions.
</callout>
### Status Workflow (Closers)
**Application Received → Setter Triage → Booked → Pre-Call Done → **<span color="green">**Closed / No-Close / No-Show**</span>
---
### Required Fields on Every Contact
- Name, phone, email, Instagram handle
- **Setter triage notes** — READ THESE before every call. They shape your entire approach.
- Financial situation (budget, capital access)
- Main pain point / goal
- Objections raised (on triage and close call)
- Call outcome + detailed notes (3+ sentences minimum)
---
### After Every Call — 4 Required Actions
1. Update lead status immediately
2. Write detailed notes (minimum 3 sentences — situation, objections, outcome)
3. Set follow-up task if no-close
4. Fill out Closer Post-Call Notes form (Typeform link in welcome block)
---
### Smart Views to Know
- **"My Booked Calls"** — Your pipeline for today
- **"No-Close Follow Up"** — Leads to re-engage
- **"No-Show"** — People who missed a call
- **"Closed This Month"** — Your wins for the month
</content>
</page>
